---
BasedOnStyle: Google
# const right of what it qualifies: char const*, Status const&. Google
# encourages const first but does not require it, and asks to be consistent with the code
# around; this is the one place the library departs from its preference. volatile moves
# with it. clang-format --dry-run in tools/lint.sh fails on a const on the left.
QualifierAlignment: Right
